From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mina Her <minacle@live.com>
Date: Sun, 24 May 2026 19:57:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Enable Markdown support for composing and rendering posts

- Implement MarkdownFormatter using Redcarpet with strict sanitisation
- Extend Status model and database schema to handle text/markdown
- Update ActivityPub serializers and parsers for source content support
- Integrate Markdown input mode into the web compose interface
- Add locale strings for Markdown mode and associated UI icons
- Include comprehensive test coverage for rendering and synchronisation

Rationale: This update introduces native Markdown support, allowing users to format posts with standard syntax while ensuring interoperability across the Fediverse through consistent ActivityPub handling.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

